-- Purpose: Set a per-role connection limit (CIS 5.5) on one role.
-- Hardening Action: Set a connection limit from the approved company policy.
-- The limit comes from the approved policy profile; the role name from collected evidence.
-- Rollback (action rollback) restores the previous limit (-1 means unlimited).
-- PostgreSQL does not enforce connection limits on superusers.
ALTER ROLE {{ role_name | ident }} CONNECTION LIMIT {{ connection_limit | pg_int }};
